---
import { LAST_CHECKED } from '../data/site';
---
<div class="container" style="max-width:920px;">
  <p role="note" style="margin:32px auto 0;padding:14px 18px;background:#FAF2DB;border:1px solid #EEDBBA;border-radius:12px;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.55;color:#3f3113;">
    <strong>Typical price; varies by location. Last checked {LAST_CHECKED}.</strong>
    Prices are typical estimates gathered from U.S. menu boards and the DQ app. Calorie and nutrition figures come from Dairy Queen’s official U.S. nutrition information (current as of August 26, 2024) wherever DQ publishes them.
    Franchise locations set their own prices, so confirm at your local Dairy Queen. We do not sell food or take orders.
  </p>
</div>
